 strap<\/p>\n<h5>NanoStation Loco M2 Specifications:<\/h5>\n<p>\u2022 Processor Specs: Atheros MIPS 4KC, 180MHz<br \/>\n\u2022 Frequency: 2.4Ghz Channels 1-11 (Channels 12-14 available in INTL version, contact sales@balticnetworks.com for ordering information)<br \/>\n\u2022 Memory Information: 16MB SDRAM, 4MB Flash<br \/>\n\u2022 Networking Interface: 1 X 10\/100 BASE-TX (Cat. 5, RJ-45) Ethernet Interface<\/p>\n<h5>Technical Information and Support<\/h5>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.balticnetworks.com\/docs\/nsm_ds_web.pdf\">NanoStation Loco M2 Data Sheet<\/a><br \/>\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.balticnetworks.com\/docs\/NanoStation_M_Loco_M_QSG.pdf\">Nanostation Quick Start Guide<\/a><br \/>\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.balticnetworks.com\/ubnttechnicalsupport\">Technical Support<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"750000","regular_price":"750000","sale_price":"750000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"KES","currency_symbol":"KSh","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" KSh"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">7,500.00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">KSh<\/span><\/span> <small class=\"woocommerce-price-suffix\">+VAT<\/small>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":128,"src":"https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2.jpg 440w, https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2-80x80.jpg 80w, https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/locom2-100x100.jpg 100w","sizes":"(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/network-options.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\